  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 33%;"><img src="https://images.code.org/b1fc5d6373768d934a185a0d24122b55-image-1784158994756.41.54 PM.png" alt="A code snippet with the incorrect parameter three" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    <td style="text-align: left; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; font-size:14pt;">
      The use of the <i> number 3</i> is incorrect syntax in this option.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 33%;"><img src="https://images.code.org/afc73d6ddc98d0fb2deec61cd295c634-image-1784158757022.38.38 PM.png" alt="The correct code snippet" style="width: 100%;"></td>
    <td style="text-align: left; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; font-size:14pt;">
